== svm.SVC multiclass: ovo layout, votes, ovr transformation, break_ties, Platt / pairwise coupling
ok   SVC multiclass: support vectors grouped by class in classes_ order with n_support_ counts; dual_coef_ shape (n_classes-1, n_SV); intercept_ shape n(n-1)/2
