ok   SVC(decision_function_shape='ovo') = the 6 pairwise decisions '0 vs 1', '0 vs 2', ..., '2 vs 3' recomputed from the documented dual_coef_ layout (SV of class i vs class j uses row j-1, SV of class j uses row i)
   grid of 900 query points: 5 with tied vote counts
ok   SVC predict (ovo) = class with most pairwise votes (positive decision votes for class i in 'i vs j')
